{"id":"641174","name":"茴香肉龙","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/641174/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小茴香","amount":"120"},{"name":"肉糜","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"自磨面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5g"},{"name":"干面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"温水里放酵母。","img":"images/641174/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放面粉，婆婆自己淘洗的麦子磨的面粉，乎乎的，不过味道很好。","img":"images/641174/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成面团，放温暖处发酵。","img":"images/641174/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/641174/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取肉糜。","img":"images/641174/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放食用油，食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/641174/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀放生抽。","img":"images/641174/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再次拌匀。","img":"images/641174/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"茴香叶子部分处理干净。","img":"images/641174/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/641174/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放肉馅里，加些许清水，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/641174/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"把发好的面取出来，揉光排气，分成4份。","img":"images/641174/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/641174/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"铺上馅料。","img":"images/641174/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"卷起来。","img":"images/641174/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"二次发酵好。","img":"images/641174/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"入蒸锅。","img":"images/641174/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"大火烧开，中火蒸25分钟，焖5分钟。","img":"images/641174/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放至温热，取出来，切块。","img":"images/641174/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/641174/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}